From 8462517a04dfacfa444cc51a5eae67101f29ce00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r1metal <r1metal@localhost>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:58:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sound: aw87xxx: LF line ends in the files the next patch
 changes

git am strips the CR from patch lines, so a text patch never applies to
a CRLF file. aw87xxx.c, aw87xxx_dsp.c and aw87xxx_monitor.c, which the
next patch changes, get LF line ends and change in nothing else. The
patch is binary for the same reason.
---
 sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx.c         | Bin 48109 -> 46443 bytes
 sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx_dsp.c     | Bin 8305 -> 7950 bytes
 sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx_monitor.c | Bin 33031 -> 31818 bytes
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx.c b/sound/soc/mediatek/aw87xxx/aw87xxx.c
index 483618814b5d12275707caf0eb815cfb9c41ee01..016c657490beb0365e4fcb3f4b3346ca68deaa9e 100755
GIT binary patch
